      "group": "radar",
      "method": "http",
      "url": "https://api.gdeltproject.org/api/v2/doc/doc?query=%28war%20OR%20conflict%20OR%20airstrike%20OR%20missile%20OR%20shelling%20OR%20invasion%20OR%20%22drone%20strike%22%20OR%20ceasefire%29&mode=ArtList&maxrecords=200&format=json&timespan=24H&sort=DateDesc",
      "expected_frequency": "hourly",
      "file_extension": "json",
      "evidence_class": "observado",
      "options": {
        "parser": "gdelt_doc",
        "timeout_seconds": 60
      },
      "notes": "Radar noticioso global. Cada artigo e sinal OSINT observado; a manchete nao e tratada como fato confirmado sem corroboracao."
